{"title":"Pedestal","slug":"Pedestal","hero":{"file":"Pedestal.in.rock.spirals.webp","width":331,"height":311},"pageid":1645,"revid":18034,"timestamp":"2025-06-03T22:02:24Z","lastEditor":"Tr4n1aa","categories":["Locations"],"infobox":null,"sections":[],"body":"<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: A pedstal near rock spirals\">A pedstal near rock spirals</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>A pedstal near rock spirals</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><b>Pedestals</b> were carried over from the old map and function in the same manner. They are located in 4 places; near <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Alan's_Auto/\"><b>Alan's</b> <b>auto</b></a>, near <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Skull_Rock/\"><b>Skull rock</b></a>, near the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lighthouse/\"><b>lighthouse</b></a> (In the Lost Woods), and on the rocky spikes.\n</p><p>The pedestals are used for obtaining both the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Uncertain_Pickaxe/\"><b>Uncertain Pickaxe</b></a> and the <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Adurite_Key/\">Adurite Key</a>.</b>\n</p>"}
